<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">{{if index .Data "promoted"}}A place opened up for you on the waiting list. {{end}}Your registration is confirmed. At the door, show this QR code or your ticket in the app.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;">
<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">Event</td><td style="padding:2px 0;"><strong>{{index .Data "event_title"}}</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">Organiser</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{index .Data "org_name"}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">When</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{index .Data "when"}} (Istanbul time)</td></tr>
{{if index .Data "location"}}<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">Where</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{index .Data "location"}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;text-align:center;"><img src="cid:ticket-qr" width="240" height="240" alt="Ticket QR code" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;border:0;"></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;text-align:center;">If the QR code cannot be read, tell the staff this code:<br><strong style="font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;">{{index .Data "manual_code"}}</strong></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><a href="{{index .Data "ticket_url"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">Open your ticket in Koro</a> (you can also cancel your registration there).</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#52525b;">This ticket is yours alone; do not share the QR code or the code: the first scan at the door wins. The calendar file (etkinlik.ics) is attached.</p>
